id: pm-ogzvx6
title: Adopt the next mature tooling maintenance cohort after registry cooldown
description: "Live October27 registry census finds SentryCLI3.8.2, marked18.1.2, TypeScriptESLint8.72.1, Stryker core/runner10.1.1, Knip6.43.0 and Unicorn79.0.0 newer than this checkout. All are younger than the enforced seven-day cooldown: about5.47,1.31,1.22,4.13,3.58 and4.24days respectively. Preserve the completed finite October20 owner pm-wb25c1. Recheck package ages and supported Node/compiler/peer contracts before adoption; keep Stryker pins synchronized and treat Unicorn79 as a reviewed major. No current advisory or open Dependabot PR requires bypassing cooldown. Separate Vitest5/CodSpeed6, Sentry11, TypeScript7 and npm-package-arg14 migrations retain their canonical owners."
