comments[9]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-27T22:24:28.217Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete strict3143-item all-status corpus, live open/in-progress lists, dependency maintenance and cooldown cohort searches, and full live pm-wb25c1 metadata confirm the prior finite cohort is closed and no open owner covers these new versions. This is future maintenance intake only, open and unclaimed."
  "2026-10-27T22:25:22.658Z","harness:codex","Primary public-registry metadata confirms latest SentryCLI3.8.2 age5.47days, marked18.1.2 age1.31days, TypeScriptESLint8.72.1 age1.22days, Stryker core+runner10.1.1 age4.13days, Knip6.43.0 age3.58days and Unicorn79 age4.24days. All are below seven days. Major owners remain pm-fokyhh for Vitest/coverage5.0.5 plus CodSpeed6.1.0, pm-t3jxjj for Sentry11, pm-do5b for TypeScript7 and pm-ksr40d for npm-package-arg14. Latest CodSpeed peers include Vitest5, as already recorded on its owner; compatibility/migration gates still need implementation. Current pnpm audit reports zero vulnerabilities across567 dependencies and GitHub has zero open dependency alerts or update PRs. Keep this intake open/unclaimed; no dependency version or policy is changed in the SDK input PR."
  "2026-10-28T15:37:34.581Z","harness:codex","Live October28 registry refresh: Sentry CLI3.8.2 age6.19days, marked18.1.2 age2.03days, typescript-eslint8.72.1 age1.93days, Stryker10.1.1 age4.84days, Greptile3.8.0 age1.71days, Knip6.43.0 age4.29days, Unicorn79 age4.96days and ext-apps2.0.4 age1.35days remain below seven-day cooldown. Existing major-migration owners remain separate. GitHub census finds zero open PRs and zero Dependabot, code-scanning or secret-scanning alerts. No dependency upgrade or policy bypass is justified in this context-read delivery."
  "2026-10-29T07:43:27.356Z","harness:codex","Live 2026-10-29 07:42Z registry metadata: SentryCLI3.8.2 is6.86days old, ext-apps2.0.4=2.02, marked18.1.2=2.70, typescript-eslint8.72.1=2.61, Stryker10.1.1=5.52, Greptile3.8.0=2.38, Knip6.43.0=4.96, Unicorn79=5.63. All maintenance candidates remain below seven days. Vitest5/CodSpeed6, TypeScript7 and npm-package-arg14 retain their existing major-migration owners and acceptance work. No open dependency PR or security alert found. This audit does not claim those migrations completed."
  "2026-10-29T11:11:40.558Z","harness:codex","The Sentry CLI 3.8.2 candidate reached seven days at October29 11:03:02UTC during delivery. Its finite adoption is owned by linked leaf pm-sentry-cli-382. This existing cohort remains open and unclaimed for the other not-yet-eligible candidates and their compatibility review; it is not duplicated or declared fully adopted."
  "2026-11-01T21:07:04.241Z","harness:claude-code","Registry census 2026-11-01 ~21:50Z (pnpm outdated + npm view time), seven-day cooldown applied. Nothing is eligible today:\n- marked 18.1.2: eligible 2026-11-02 14:54Z\n- typescript-eslint 8.72.1: eligible 2026-11-02 17:09Z\n- greptile 3.8.0: eligible 2026-11-02 22:38Z\n- @modelcontextprotocol/ext-apps 2.0.4: eligible 2026-11-03 07:16Z (vendored-Zod caveat owned by pm-extapps-vendor-zod)\n- @types/node 26.6.6: eligible 2026-11-04 18:36Z\n- eslint 10.14.0: eligible 2026-11-06 14:12Z\n- knip 6.44.0: eligible 2026-11-05 19:44Z; 6.44.1: 2026-11-07 10:40Z (pin exact, as for 6.43.0)\n\nMajors keep their existing owners: @sentry/node 11.10.0 (runtime bundle budget, pm-t3jxjj), TypeScript 7.0.2 and npm-package-arg 14.0.0. Dependabot alerts 0, code-scanning 0, secret-scanning 0, no open dependency PRs. The earliest useful cohort run is 2026-11-03 (marked, typescript-eslint, greptile, ext-apps).\n"
  "2026-11-02T08:29:23.143Z","harness:claude-code","Correction (2026-11-02): the 2026-11-01 registry census comment states its time as ~21:50Z, but the comment itself was recorded at 21:07:04Z. The npm view time queries that produced it ran at 2026-11-01T20:28:57Z, so the census time is ~20:29Z. The eligibility instants listed there are publish time plus the seven-day cooldown and are unaffected."
  "2026-11-09T07:33:17.876Z","harness:codex","Fresh intake: adopting the mature maintenance cohort proposed by Dependabot PRs 1690 and 1691 in the combined SDK-recovery PR. PR 1691 previously passed all tests with 100 percent coverage but failed the external Codecov binary download with HTTP 504. Preserve cooldown, runtime budget, exact coverage and analyzer requirements."
  "2026-11-09T07:59:55.560Z","harness:codex","Current maintenance cohort: ext-apps2.0.4, Node types26.6.6, ESLint10.14.0, Greptile3.8.0, Knip6.44.1, Marked18.1.2, parse5 8.1.0, typescript-eslint8.72.1, CodSpeed5.6.1 and TruffleHog3.99.8. Exact registry timestamps were checked: all npm candidates are older than seven days. pnpm install with frozen lockfile passed and audit reports zero known vulnerabilities across552 resolved dependencies. Latest pm-changelog2026.11.7 installs and activates without failures. Sentry11 PR1692 remains deferred under its canonical owner after exact-head compilation failure; no ignore or cooldown exceptions were introduced."
